### single-quoted uppercase range in tr misses accented letters
tr 'a-z' 'A-Z' < names.txt
>>> SC2018 1:4
>>> SC2019 1:10

### unquoted uppercase range in tr
printf '%s\n' "$label" | tr A-Z _
>>> SC2019 1:29
>>> SC2154 1:16

### uppercase range text without a tr command is ignored
A-Z N-ZA-M
>>> none

### bracketed uppercase range gets the bracket warning instead
tr '_' '[A-Z]' < input.log
>>> SC2021 1:8
